2026-09-13T02:46:50.3365857Z [36;1m# disabled take 70.8 s at -j2 and 43.1 s at -j4 -- 1.64x, at identical[0m
2026-09-13T02:46:50.3366314Z [36;1m# user time. Peak RSS per unity object is ~834 MB, so four in flight is[0m
2026-09-13T02:46:50.3366680Z [36;1m# ~3.3 GB of the runner's 16 GB.[0m
